{"thread":{"threadID":3614,"boardID":227,"topic":"Forum emoticons","time":1464993060,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","lastPostTime":1465135115,"lastPoster":"Pixel","replies":12,"views":982,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[{"tagID":850,"name":"Suggestion"}],"posts":[{"postID":47731,"threadID":3614,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"Forum emoticons","time":1464993060,"lastEditTime":1464993374,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2199,"editor":"OxygeN","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>It would be cool for Sky or Blackfire to add new emoticons such as<br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>//EDIT: People are able to leave their suggestions.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47732,"threadID":3614,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"","time":1464993880,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>In my honest opinion, I think the forum has enough emoticons for now, to add more may be more of a hassle for @&quot;sky&#x27; and <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> so I would say it has a lower priority.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>But adding them would be cool nevertheless <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span> Only about if they have the time to do so x)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Doo Doo</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47737,"threadID":3614,"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","subject":"","time":1465030235,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Well, they have already wasted their time in these emoticons... <span class=\"missin